[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.2 System overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SQAP-001-MILUAV
TITLE: System Overview
STATEMENT: The Military Quad Copter RTOS requires comprehensive quality assurance for safety-critical, real-time, and secure military UAV operations.
RATIONALE: System overview provides context for quality assurance.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.3 Document overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SQAP-002-MILUAV
TITLE: Document Structure
STATEMENT: This document covers quality assurance organization, referenced documents, quality assurance activities, and quality metrics per MIL-STD-498.
RATIONALE: Structured documentation supports effective quality assurance.

[[/SECTION]]

